title: Grep for every reader of a file the system writes
pid: 9750fd8c-1d12-45bd-b6fa-260f951a5ac5
body: |2-
  Before a plan moves a log, a lock or a generated script, 'git
  grep' its name across the whole tree, 'windows/', 'tools/' and
  'tests/' included, and list every reader in the code map. Plan
  1_2 found three Windows scripts and the integration test library
  reading the moved logs only while its slices ran.
